//  Two anima connect through the 5-ch TENSION field: anima A's tension state,
//  carried by a kosmos anchor, modulates anima B's emit decision via the real
//  brain_decide_anchored fold (H_1131). tension_5ch vectors come from REAL ANU
//  paid quantum bytes (/tmp/anu_tension.txt, written by the python prep).
//
//  Unlike the quantum no-signaling case, the tension link IS a real channel
//  (shared anchor) → it CAN carry A's state into B's decision (genuine influence).
